# Title: Add Windows Capability Via PowerShell Cmdlet
# ID: b36d01a3-ddaf-4804-be18-18a6247adfcd
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-01-22
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects usage of the "Add-WindowsCapability" cmdlet to add Windows capabilities. Notable capabilities could be "OpenSSH" and others.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_exec="*OpenSSH.*") AND (process_exec="*Add-WindowsCapability*") AND (((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll"))))
